        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Electoral district of Goulburn, Adelaide, New South Wales\n- People: Pru Goward, Prudence Jane Goward\n- Organizations: Liberal Party of Australia, Berejiklian government\n- Roles: Member for Goulburn, Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault, Minister for Family and Community Services, Minister for Social Housing\n\nFacts:\n- Prudence Jane Goward was born on 2 September 1952 in Adelaide.\n- Prudence Jane Goward is an Australian politician.\n- Pru Goward represents the Electoral district of Goulburn.\n- Pru Goward is a member of the Liberal Party of Australia.\n- Pru Goward has served as the New South Wales Minister for Prevention of Domestic Violence and Sexual Assault since 2015.\n- Pru Goward has served as the New South Wales Minister for Family and Community Services and Minister for Social Housing since January 2017 in the Berejiklian government.",
